WEBVTT

00:50:58.413 --> 00:51:03.246
like inspirational or self-help like that.
And there are never books.

00:51:03.246 --> 00:51:04.663
There's never like novels there.

00:51:04.996 --> 00:51:07.329
There's never, you know, tiny,
beautiful things there.

00:51:07.329 --> 00:51:11.079
It's all these very specific things
that are very instructive, like,

00:51:11.288 --> 00:51:13.454
here's your problem. Here's
what you need to do.

00:51:13.871 --> 00:51:18.913
And I find that the most helpful
literature when it comes to like what

00:51:18.913 --> 00:51:23.871
real self-help is, is things like, I
don't know, Jane Eyre, you know,

00:51:24.246 --> 00:51:27.996
Alice Munro. Short stories. There I am.
And Alice Munro, short stories.

00:51:27.996 --> 00:51:31.204
There I am. And Toni Morrison's beloved.
There I am.